Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:08.70,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.31,0:02:05.60,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.73,0:02:08.44,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, fight！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:11.11,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  开怀欢笑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:13.70,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.81,0:02:14.63,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Precure~！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.53,0:02:18.44,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Yes！P·re·cu·re·5！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.58,0:02:22.91,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,长大后想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.48,0:02:25.18,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想·做·想做·什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:27.95,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想亲手尝试的事有很多！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.01,0:02:30.18,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,很・多・都・想・做！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:35.17,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,哭鼻子是不能解决问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:39.34,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.14,0:02:44.51,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:44.15,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.31,0:02:48.73,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.60,0:02:47.97,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:48.63,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:49.80,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:54.12,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.14,0:02:53.46,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.71,0:02:54.11,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.51,0:02:55.35,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:02:59.86,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:03.28,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.77,0:03:05.17,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:06.54,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,GoGo！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.14,0:03:09.08,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go Go Go Go！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:08.04,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转危为机 坚强地变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:12.06,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:11.83,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:14.74,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:14.33,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, Huslte！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:17.05,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  喜笑颜开
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.13,0:03:19.67,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.83,0:03:20.20,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.03,0:03:21.54,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
